[2261]={id=2261,name="rusted pickaxe",plural="rusted pickaxes",description="\nFished up from foul water, this\npickaxe is covered with rust from\nits pointed edge all the way down\nits shaft.",category=2},
[2262]={id=2262,name="tiny seed",plural="tiny seeds",description="\nA tiny seed Kyff found during his\nadventures in the forests of Ulbuka.",category=2},
[2263]={id=2263,name="bottle of fertilizer X",plural="bottles of fertilizer X",description="\nA bottle of highly potent fertilizer\ndesigned by the Inventors' Coalition\nfor use in growing vegetables and\nplants in the Civic Arboretum.",category=2},
[2264]={id=2264,name="waypoint scanner kit",plural="waypoint scanner kits",description="\nThis kit emits copious amounts of steam\nand its gears are grinding noisily.\nCould it really be used to examine\npotential issues with the waypoints?",category=2},
[2265]={id=2265,name="royal fiat banning colonization",plural="copies of the royal fiat banning colonization",description="\nAn official missive from the king to\nhis ministers, stating: \"Henceforth,\nparticipation in colonization-related\nactivities is prohibited. We\ndecree that the city shall refocus\nits resources on mercantile pursuits,\nthe execution of which shall be\nentrusted to the leaders of the\nTwelve Orders.\"",category=2},
[2266]={id=2266,name="record of the 17th Assembly",plural="copies of the 17th Assembly's records",description="\nOutlined in these minutes is the\nabolition of royal sovereignty and\nthe establishment of a legislative\nbody. They also record a proposal\nto increase the nation's authority\nabroad by enhancing its naval\nresources.",category=2},
[2267]={id=2267,name="copy of the alliance agreement",plural="copies of the alliance agreement",description="\nRatified by all leaders of the\nTwelve Orders, this document\ntestifies to the formation of the\nSacred City of Adoulin Alliance and\nits current political body.",category=2},
[2268]={id=2268,name="Ulbukan navigation chart",plural="copies of an Ulbukan navigation chart",description="\nWeathered by years of exposure to\nsea salt winds, this parchment is\ncovered with faint lines delineating\nthe myriad currents and trade routes\nin the vicinity of the Eastern Ulbuka\narchipelago, along with barely\nlegible letters spelling \"Tavnazia.\"",category=3},
[2269]={id=2269,name="copy of \"Adoulin's Patroness\"",plural="copies of \"Adoulin's Patroness\"",description="\n\"Oh, Mistress Svenja!\nThy soft embrace doth rid pioneers\nof their sorrows, and thy smile the sun's impetus\nto rise every morrow.\nI cannot express how much I love\nthee, Mistress Svenja,\nexcept to say you set me free.\"",category=2},
[2270]={id=2270,name="memo from Midras",plural="memos from Midras",description="\nThis parchment inked in hastily\nscribbled script contains the name\nof a chemical substance that Midras\nneeds to procure from his father,\nCid.",category=2},
[2271]={id=2271,name="Cid's catalyst",plural="Cid's catalysts",description="\nThis finely-ground yellow powder\nsmells of fetid ash. Midras requires\nit to create an explosive substance.",category=2},
[2272]={id=2272,name="chunk of milky white minerals",plural="chunks of milky white minerals",description="\nThis fist-sized rock mined in\nSih Gates contains a variety of\nsubstances said to aid in the\ncreation of more efficient,\npotent vegetable fertilizer.",category=2},
[2273]={id=2273,name="F.A.I.L. badge",plural="F.A.I.L. badges",description="\nA flimsy pin with childish scribblings\non it that announce the bearer's\naffiliation with the Fantastic\nAdoulin Imperial Liberators.",category=2},
[2274]={id=2274,name="Western Adoulin patrol route",plural="Western Adoulin patrol routes",description="\n\"Pioneers' Coalition ⇒\nCouriers' Coalition ⇒\nAdoulin Waterfront ⇒\nPlatea Triumphus ⇒\nInventors' Coalition ⇒\nWharf with ships bound for Adoulin's\nresidential district ⇒\nMummers' Coalition ⇒\nReport back.\"",category=2},
[2275]={id=2275,name="misdelivered parcel",plural="misdelivered parcels",description="\nOriginally destined for C-6 in the\nRala Waterways, the Couriers'\nCoalition accidentally sent this\npackage to the Adoulin Waterfront.\nIt looks to have been struck with a\nsword numerous times and is\ncovered in strange symbols.",category=2},
[2276]={id=2276,name="Eastern Adoulin patrol route",plural="Eastern Adoulin patrol routes",description="\n\"Peacekeepers' Coalition ⇒\nWharf to Yahse Hunting Grounds ⇒\nStatue of the Goddess ⇒\nMinister of education's residence ⇒\nAdoulin Castle ⇒ Docks to\nAdoulin's residential area ⇒\nScouts' Coalition ⇒\nReport back.\"",category=3},
[2277]={id=2277,name="hot springs care package",plural="hot springs care packages",description="\nWhat better way to lure in an old\nman visiting the hot springs in\nMorimar Basalt Fields than with\nsome boiled eggs and fruit-flavored\nmilk?",category=2},
[2278]={id=2278,name="fistful of homeland soil",plural="fistfuls of homeland soil",description="\nThe smell of this light brown soil\nreminds you of your pre-adventuring\nyouth. Perhaps Sylvie can use this\nto construct your luopan.",category=2},
[2279]={id=2279,name="Yahse wildflower petal",plural="Yahse wildflower petals",description="\nPicked from a flower that only\ngrows along the shore of the\nYahse Hunting Grounds, petals such\nas this are rumored to be the\nmain ingredient in a distinctive\noccult ink.",category=2},
[2280]={id=2280,name="habitual behavior barometer",plural="habitual behavior barometers",description="\nA handheld device based on the spatial pressure barometer developed in the Near East and modified by the Armathrwn Society, you\nneed only keep it in your possession\nto collect all the necessary data\nfrom Naakual dwellings.",category=2},
[2281]={id=2281,name="brier-proof net",plural="brier-proof nets",description="\nComposed of strong metallic links,\nthis net may weigh one down a tad,\nbut it also provides unrivaled\nprotection against limb-severing\ngroves of thorny plants.",category=2},
[2282]={id=2282,name="compass of transference",plural="compasses of transference",description="\nBased on the technology employed\nin airship propulsion, this mechanism\ntransports its bearer to the\nepicenter of an extremely murky\nenergy distortion.",category=2},
[2283]={id=2283,name="magma mitigation set",plural="magma mitigation sets",description="\nSpecially crafted from heat-resistant\nmaterials, this set of boots and\ngloves will prevent pioneers with\neven the most delicate skin from\nsuffering a single burn while\nclimbing the searing heat of\nmafic cliffs.",category=2},
[2284]={id=2284,name="resurrection retardant axe",plural="resurrection retardant axes",description="\nCoated with a solution that impedes\nthe regrowth of any trees with which\nit comes into contact, this\nbattle-axe allows its bearer passage\nthrough even the most impenetrable\nof Eastern Ulbukan thickets. Its\nblades degrade quickly once coated,\nhowever, and cannot be used more\nthan once.",category=2},
[2285]={id=2285,name="insulator tablet",plural="insulator tablets",description="\nOnce consumed, this bitter medicine\nvastly limits the body's ability to\nconduct electricity. While it begins\nworking nearly instantaneously, its\neffects don't last much longer. Due\nto a horde of dangerous side\neffects, surveyors highly caution\nagainst using it in quick succession.",category=3},
[2286]={id=2286,name="anti-glaciation gear",plural="sets of anti-glaciation gear",description="\nThis set of climbing gear consists of\na finely woven coat and a trusty ice\npick. The coat's sorcery-imbued\nfibers perform the dual function of\nincreasing the amount of heat\nemitted from one's frame and\ntrapping it. The pick is coated with\na special substance that bonds to\nwhatever it comes in contact with,\nensuring pioneers do not get blown\naway.",category=3},
[2288]={id=2288,name="Land of Milk and Honey hive",plural="Land of Milk and Honey hives",description="\nTrue to its name, this beehive\ncollects divine honey and nectar.\nOne of the Inventors' Coalition's\nsecret weapons, it has the strange\npower to attract bees and wasps of\nall shapes and sizes.",category=2},
[2289]={id=2289,name="full Land of Milk and Honey hive",plural="full Land of Milk and Honey hives",description="\nThis beehive is almost completely\nfull, with ten bees stored inside.",category=2},
[2290]={id=2290,name="luopan",plural="luopans",description="\nThis tiny object serves as a pylon\nof geomantic energies. No true\ngeomancer would be caught dead\nwithout one.",category=2},
[2291]={id=2291,name="Rala simulacrum",plural="Rala simulacra",description="\nA statue assembled from three\ndifferent segments that grants its\nbearer access to skirmishes in\nRala Waterways [U].",category=2},
[2292]={id=2292,name="Yorcia simulacrum",plural="Yorcia simulacra",description="\nA statue assembled from three\ndifferent segments that grants its\nbearer access to skirmishes in\nYorcia Weald [U].",category=2},
[2293]={id=2293,name="Cirdas simulacrum",plural="Cirdas simulacra",description="\nA statue assembled from three\ndifferent segments that grants its\nbearer access to skirmishes in\nCirdas Caverns [U].",category=2},
[2294]={id=2294,name="Ra'Kaznar simulacrum",plural="Ra'Kaznar simulacra",description="\nA statue assembled from three\ndifferent segments that grants its\nbearer access to skirmishes in\nRa'Kaznar [U].",category=2},
[2296]={id=2296,name="celadon yantric planchette",plural="celadon yantric planchettes",description="\nThis board is made of finely\npolished celadon yggrete and is attuned\nto lift the veil shrouding a fracture\nin Ceizak Battlegrounds.",category=2},
[2297]={id=2297,name="zaffre yantric planchette",plural="zaffre yantric planchettes",description="\nThis board is made of finely\npolished zaffre yggrete and is\nattuned to lift the veil shrouding a\nfracture in Foret de Hennetiel.",category=2},
[2298]={id=2298,name="alizarin yantric planchette",plural="alizarin yantric planchettes",description="\nThis board is made of finely\npolished alizarin yggrete and is\nattuned to lift the veil shrouding a\nfracture in Morimar Basalt Fields.",category=3},
[2299]={id=2299,name="detached stinger",plural="detached stingers",description="\nRipped from the abdomen of the\nvicious Muyingwa, this stinger drips\nwith a venom so acidic that it\ninstantaneously sears any flesh with\nwhich it comes in contact.",category=2},
[2300]={id=2300,name="craggy fin",plural="craggy fins",description="\nTorn from the back of the foul\nDakuwaqa, this deep grey appendage\ncuts with such precision that it\ncauses eddies to form in the flesh it\nslices through.",category=2},
[2301]={id=2301,name="flame-scarred skull",plural="flame-scarred skulls",description="\nSevered from the lifeless body of\nthe nefarious Tojil, this skull\ncontains black patches that mark\nthe dancing of unholy flames.",category=2},
[2302]={id=2302,name="map of Rala Waterways [U]",plural="maps of Rala Waterways [U]",description="\nA map of Rala Waterways [U].\n\nDisplays your party members' current\nlocation.",category=2},
[2303]={id=2303,name="map of Yorcia Weald [U]",plural="maps of Yorcia Weald [U]",description="\nA map of Yorcia Weald [U].\n\nDisplays your party members' current\nlocation.",category=2},
[2304]={id=2304,name="map of Cirdas Caverns [U]",plural="maps of Cirdas Caverns [U]",description="\nA map of Cirdas Caverns [U].\n\nDisplays your party members' current\nlocation.",category=2},
[2305]={id=2305,name="map of Outer Ra'Kaznar [U]",plural="maps of Outer Ra'Kaznar [U]",description="\nA map of Outer Ra'Kaznar [U].\n\nDisplays your party members' current\nlocation.",category=2},
[2307]={id=2307,name="map of Escha - Zi'Tah",plural="maps of Escha - Zi'Tah",description="\nA map of Escha - Zi'Tah.\n\nDisplays your party members' current\nlocation.",category=2},
[2308]={id=2308,name="map of Escha - Ru'Aun",plural="maps of Escha - Ru'Aun",description="\nA map of Escha - Ru'Aun.\n\nDisplays your party members' current\nlocation.",category=2},
[2309]={id=2309,name="map of Reisenjima",plural="maps of Reisenjima",description="\nA map of Reisenjima.\n\nDisplays your party members' current\nlocation.",category=2},
[2334]={id=2334,name="Mog Kupon A-DeII",plural="Mog Kupons A-DeII",description="\nIssued by the Mog House Management Union (MHMU).\nTradeable for spoils from bosses in Delve.",category=2},
[2335]={id=2335,name="Mog Kupon A-De",plural="Mog Kupons A-De",description="\nIssued by the Mog House Management Union (MHMU).\nTradeable for spoils from notorious monsters in Delve.",category=2},
[2336]={id=2336,name="Mog Kupon A-Sal",plural="Mog Kupons A-Sal",description="\nIssued by the Mog House Management Union (MHMU).\nTradeable for Salvge +1 armor.",category=2},
[2337]={id=2337,name="Mog Kupon A-Nyz",plural="Mog Kupons A-Nyz",description="\nIssued by the Mog House Management Union (MHMU).\nTradeable for armor from Nyzul Isle Uncharted Survey.",category=2},
[2338]={id=2338,name="Mog Kupon I-S5",plural="Mog Kupons I-S5",description="\nIssued by the Mog House Management Union (MHMU).\nTradeable for rank V simulacra segments.",category=2},
[2339]={id=2339,name="Mog Kupon I-S2",plural="Mog Kupons I-S2",description="\nIssued by the Mog House Management Union (MHMU).\nTradeable for rank II simulacra segments.",category=2},
[2340]={id=2340,name="Mog Kupon I-Orche",plural="Mog Kupons I-Orche",description="\nIssued by the Mog House Management Union (MHMU).\nTradeable for orchestrion sheet music.",category=2},
[2341]={id=2341,name="sheet of E. Adoulinian tunes",plural="sheets of E. Adoulinian tunes",description="\nSheet music that can be played on\nan orchestrion.\n\nMusic List:\nThe Sacred City of Adoulin",category=2},
[2342]={id=2342,name="sheet of W. Adoulinian tunes",plural="sheets of W. Adoulinian tunes",description="\nSheet music that can be played on\nan orchestrion.\n\nMusic List:\nThe Pioneers",category=2},
[2343]={id=2343,name="Hennebloom leaf",plural="Hennebloom leaves",description="\nThis bumpy leaf was torn off a small\ncobalt flower growing in the farthest\nreaches of Foret de Hennetiel.",category=2},
[2344]={id=2344,name="impure celadon yggzi",plural="impure celadon yggzi",description="\nA petrified celadon yggzi bead of\nquestionable quality.",category=3},
[2345]={id=2345,name="semi-pure celadon yggzi",plural="semi-pure celadon yggzi",description="\nA semi-pure petrified celadon yggzi\nbead with large variances in shape.",category=2},
[2346]={id=2346,name="impure zaffre yggzi",plural="impure zaffre yggzi",description="\nA petrified zaffre yggzi bead of\nquestionable quality.",category=3},
[2347]={id=2347,name="semi-pure zaffre yggzi",plural="semi-pure zaffre yggzi",description="\nA semi-pure petrified zaffre yggzi\nbead with large variances in shape.",category=2},
[2348]={id=2348,name="impure alizarin yggzi",plural="impure alizarin yggzi",description="\nA petrified alizarin yggzi bead of\nquestionable quality.",category=3},
[2349]={id=2349,name="semi-pure alizarin yggzi",plural="semi-pure alizarin yggzi",description="\nA semi-pure petrified alizarin yggzi\nbead with large variances in shape.",category=2},
[2350]={id=2350,name="ring of supernal disjunction",plural="rings of supernal disjunction",description="\nA simply crafted ring of gold that\nseparates spirit from body and\nenables its bearer to possess bestial\nvessels.",category=2},
[2351]={id=2351,name="gladiatorial writ of summons",plural="gladiatorial writs of summons",description="\nA surreal document with letters that\nseem to hover above the parchment\nupon which they were written, this\ntestimonial serves as evidence that\nits bearer is a gladiator and thus\npermitted to combat monipulators.",category=2},
[2352]={id=2352,name="\"Ephemeral Endeavor\"",plural="\"Ephemeral Endeavor\" runes",description="\nThis rune--engraved by Octavien--\nsignifies that its bearer has spread\ntheir wings and soared to new\nheights as a rune fencer.",category=3},
[2353]={id=2353,name="\"Enlightened Endeavor\"",plural="\"Enlightened Endeavor\" runes",description="\nBestowed upon rune fencers\nendeavoring to ascend to greater\nheights, the character itself\ncontinuously exudes an occult aura\naround its bearer.",category=3},
[2354]={id=2354,name="rune saber",plural="rune sabers",description="\nA blade so thin that it cannot be\nused in combat. It responds to all\nrunic elements and glows a pale\nshade of blue.",category=2},
[2355]={id=2355,name="flask of fruiserum",plural="flasks of fruiserum",description="\nThis liquid can ice over entire rivers\nof magma in an instant. According\nto its label, imbibing it can also\ncause unpleasant side effects such\nas upset stomach, severe brain\nfreeze, and immediate death.",category=2},
[2356]={id=2356,name="frost-encrusted flame gem",plural="frost-encrusted flame gems",description="\nA brilliant jewel that harbors the\nelemental power of fire, which can\nbe seen raging under a thick layer\nof frost.",category=2},
[2357]={id=2357,name="letter from Octavien",plural="copies of a letter from Octavien",description="\n\"I understand that you may not have\ntime for this due to your myriad\nscholarly duties, but I beseech you\nto impart your wisdom regarding the\nmysterious runic devices to the\nmessenger who handed you this\nnote. Without either this person's\nhelp or yours, we will not be able to\nuncover the meaning behind the\ncontraptions.\"",category=2},
[2358]={id=2358,name="stone of Ignis",plural="stones of Ignis",description="\nA rune stone left behind by\nSverdhried and recovered from an\nenigmatic contraption in\nthe Eldieme Necropolis.",category=2},
[2359]={id=2359,name="stone of Gelus",plural="stones of Gelus",description="\nA rune stone left behind by\nSverdhried and recovered from an\nenigmatic contraption in\nOrdelle's Caves.",category=2},
[2360]={id=2360,name="stone of Flabra",plural="stones of Flabra",description="\nA rune stone left behind by\nSverdhried and recovered from an\nenigmatic contraption in\nthe Gusgen Mines.",category=2},
[2361]={id=2361,name="stone of Tellus",plural="stones of Tellus",description="\nA rune stone left behind by\nSverdhried and recovered from an\nenigmatic contraption in\nthe Outer Horutoto Ruins.",category=2},
[2362]={id=2362,name="stone of Sulpor",plural="stones of Sulpor",description="\nA rune stone left behind by\nSverdhried and recovered from an\nenigmatic contraption in\nCrawlers' Nest.",category=2},
[2363]={id=2363,name="stone of Unda",plural="stones of Unda",description="\nA rune stone left behind by\nSverdhried and recovered from an\nenigmatic contraption in\nDangruf Wadi.",category=2},
[2364]={id=2364,name="stone of Lux",plural="stones of Lux",description="\nA rune stone left behind by\nSverdhried and recovered from an\nenigmatic contraption in\nthe Maze of Shakhrami.",category=2},
[2365]={id=2365,name="stone of Tenebrae",plural="stones of Tenebrae",description="\nA rune stone left behind by\nSverdhried and recovered from an\nenigmatic contraption in\nGarlaige Citadel.",category=2},
[2366]={id=2366,name="stone of unknown runic origins",plural="stones of unknown runic origins",description="\nA rune stone recovered from an\nenigmatic contraption in\nKing Ranperre's Tomb.",category=2},
[2367]={id=2367,name="stone of unknown runic origins",plural="stones of unknown runic origins",description="\nA rune stone recovered from an\nenigmatic contraption in\nRanguemont Pass.",category=2},
[2368]={id=2368,name="stone of unknown runic origins",plural="stones of unknown runic origins",description="\nA rune stone recovered from an\nenigmatic contraption in\nFei'Yin.",category=2},
[2369]={id=2369,name="\"Secrets of Runic Enhancement\"",plural="copies of \"Secrets of Runic Enhancement\"",description="\nA slightly smaller tome than most of\nthis genre. A drawing of some ancient\nequipment adorns its cover, and an\nelegantly inscribed description on\nthe back claims that this volume\ncontains the most clandestine of\ntechniques for augmenting runic\nequipment.",category=2},
[2370]={id=2370,name="runic kinegraver",plural="runic kinegravers",description="\nAn unassuming cubic device that,\nwhen outfitted with a rune and\nplaced to one's forehead, projects\nmoving images for the viewer.",category=2},
[2371]={id=2371,name="vial of vivid rainbow extract",plural="vials of vivid rainbow extract",description="\nA dye fashioned from Yahse\nwildflower petals boiled in the\nwaters of a river with the rune Ignis.\nIt is used to color various pieces of\nhighly sought-after equipment and is\nrumored to act as a talisman as well.",category=2},
[2372]={id=2372,name="Insidio's extinguished lantern",plural="Insidio's extinguished lanterns",description="\nEvidence that the ogre-like orobon\nnamed Insidio has been vanquished.\nThis once mesmerizingly bright orb\nwill charm innocent bystanders no\nlonger.",category=3},
[2373]={id=2373,name="vessel of summoning",plural="vessels of summoning",description="\nThis tiny container holds a\ntranslucent green liquid said to\nlure in powerful elementals.\nGeomancers hoping to prove their\nability use this as part of their\nrites of passage.",category=2},
[2374]={id=2374,name="silver luopan",plural="silver luopans",description="\nPrepared by Sylvie, this special\nluopan can calm the rage of the\nlifestream.",category=2},
[2375]={id=2375,name="Lhaiso Neftereh's bell",plural="Lhaiso Neftereh's bells",description="\nThis ancient bell, passed down since\nthe time of Sih Renaye, confers the\nuncanny ability to converse with the\nhigher power.",category=2},
[2376]={id=2376,name="Midras's explosive sample",plural="Midras's explosive samples",description="\nThe explosive device engineered by\nMidras makes up for its lack of\nforce by employing a chemical\nreaction to shatter its target.",category=2},
[2377]={id=2377,name="report on Midras's explosive",plural="reports on Midras's explosive",description="\nThis report, scribbled hastily on\nfresh parchment, contains highly\ntechnical explanations that are\nindecipherable by the common man.",category=2},
[2378]={id=2378,name="tray of Adoulinian delicacies",plural="trays of Adoulinian delicacies",description="\nThis covered tray contains an\nexquisite meal of Adoulin's finest\nsea bounty, fished and prepared by\nAlienor herself. One person could\nnot possibly consume all of it.",category=2},
[2379]={id=2379,name="small bag of Adoulinian delicacies",plural="small bags of Adoulinian delicacies",description="\nThis small bag contains some of the\nfood Alienor prepared for her\ngrandfather, Anastase. One of the\nmembers of his expedition would\nsurely enjoy this treat.",category=2},
[2380]={id=2380,name="waypoint recalibration kit",plural="waypoint recalibration kits",description="\nThis improved version of a waypoint\nscanner kit is specially fitted to\nrecalibrate waypoints in the\nMiddle Lands.",category=2},
[2381]={id=2381,name="Twelve Orders dossier",plural="Twelve Orders dossiers",description="\nA stack of papers new and old\nreceived from Reja Ygridhi.\nInscribed upon the documents is\ninformation pertaining to each of\nAdoulin's Twelve Orders.",category=2},
[2382]={id=2382,name="ravine water testing kit",plural="ravine water testing kits",description="\nJhen Durheka has prepared this kit\nto collect and test water samples\nfrom the river in Marjami Ravine. It\ncontains three vials and a strange\napparatus.",category=2},
[2383]={id=2383,name="fistful of numbing soil",plural="fistfuls of numbing soil",description="\nThis purplish soil was collected from\nan area in Yorcia Weald where\nnumbing blossoms flourish. It is\nunfit for growing plants of any other\nspecies.",category=2},
[2384]={id=2384,name="hunk of bedrock",plural="hunks of bedrock",description="\nThis sedimentary stone excavated\nfrom a Mog Garden has a unique\npattern carved into its surface.",category=2},
[2385]={id=2385,name="Yorcia's tear",plural="Yorcia's tears",description="\nThis light, clear gem shimmers like\na small droplet of water.",category=2},
[2386]={id=2386,name="blightberry",plural="blightberries",description="\nNamed after a disease that plagues\ncrops due to its lumpy green skin\nthat looks as if it has harbored\nmold for weeks, this succulent fruit has a strikingly red center that\ndrips with decadent juices.",category=2},
[2387]={id=2387,name="large strip of Velkk hide",plural="large strips of Velkk hide",description="\nA large strip of hide cured by the\nVelkk. Though such hide is generally\nsmall and easily torn, this strip\nis large and tough.",category=2},
[2388]={id=2388,name="\"Climbing\"",plural="\"Climbing\"",description="\nA survival skill that grants the\nability to climb vines and cliffs\nthat dot the landscape of Eastern Ulbuka.",category=2},
[2389]={id=2389,name="box of Adoulinian tomatoes",plural="boxes of Adoulinian tomatoes",description="\nFresh and juicy with bright red skin,\nthese tomatoes were grown in \nAdoulin's own Civic Arboretum.\nThe seeds, however, were brought\nback from the jungle by Arciela.",category=2},
[2390]={id=2390,name="kaleidoscopic clam",plural="kaleidoscopic clams",description="\nA shellfish dragged up from the\nwaters off the coast of a\nMog Garden. This marine bivalve's\ncarapace glistens with all\nseven colors of the rainbow,\novershadowing its relatively\ndispleasing jaundiced body.",category=2},
[2391]={id=2391,name="glass pendulum",plural="glass pendulums",description="\nA crystalline device that sways\nback and forth and was salvaged\noff the coast of a Mog Garden.\nIts appearance gives no obvious\nclues as to its purpose.",category=2},
[2393]={id=2393,name="ivory wing talisman",plural="ivory wing talismans",description="\nA charm crafted in the shape of\nivory wings, the symbol of the\nGoddess Altana. Reduces the amount\nof experience lost when\nknocked out during reives.",category=3},
[2394]={id=2394,name="bronze mattock cordon",plural="bronze mattock cordons",description="\nEmbroidered with a gleaming\nbronze mattock, this badge is given\nonly to pioneers who have gone above\nand beyond the call of duty in\nadvancing the colonization\ninitiative. Increases the maximum\nnumber of coalition imprimaturs able\nto be held at one time.",category=2},
[2395]={id=2395,name="bronze shovel cordon",plural="bronze shovel cordons",description="\nEmbroidered with a gleaming\nbronze shovel, this badge is given\nonly to pioneers who have gone\nabove and beyond the call of duty\nin advancing the colonization\ninitiative. Reduces the\nwaiting period for new\ncoalition imprimaturs.",category=2},
[2396]={id=2396,name="Tarutaru Sauce invoice",plural="Tarutaru Sauce invoices",description="\nA collection of invoices addressed\nto the Mummers' Coalition. Cafe des\nLarmes: 4,560 gil; Cafeteria: 5,600\ngil; Fishmonger's stall: 6,832 gil;\nBakery: 19,440 gil; Sweets shop:\n3,000 gil.",category=2},
[2397]={id=2397,name="Tarutaru Sauce receipt",plural="Tarutaru Sauce receipts",description="\nA collection of receipts addressed\nto the Mummers' Coalition. Those\ntwo pigs surely worked up quite the\ntab...",category=2},
[2398]={id=2398,name="GPS crystal",plural="GPS crystals",description="\nIts acronym a shorthand form of\n\"Garden Positioning System\", this\nmineral device guides pioneers via\nmoogle magic to their Mog Gardens.\nIt glows with the iridescence of an\nadditional star for each day (Earth\ntime) the Green Thumb Moogle lays\nhis fuzzy paws upon it. As to what\nsignificance the stars have, that\nremains a moogle mystery.",category=2},
[2399]={id=2399,name="pair of Velkk gloves",plural="pairs of Velkk gloves",description="\nThese sturdy green gloves were\ncreated from a large Velkk hide.\nNeither the thorniest vines nor the\nsheerest of cliffs can stop a pioneer\nwho has them in his possession.",category=2},
[2400]={id=2400,name="lost article",plural="lost articles",description="\nLeft behind by a careless pioneer,\nthis article should be delivered to\nthe Mummers' Coalition with utmost\nhaste.",category=2},
[2401]={id=2401,name="lost article",plural="lost articles",description="\nLeft behind by a careless pioneer,\nthis article should be delivered to\nthe Mummers' Coalition with utmost\nhaste.",category=2},
[2402]={id=2402,name="geomancer claim ticket",plural="geomancer claim tickets",description="\nAn order slip from Wescolina\ndetailing the armor piece ordered\nfrom her shop.",category=2},
[2403]={id=2403,name="Mar. FB op. materials container",plural="containers of Marjami frontier bivouac operations materials",description="\nA collection of materials that must\nbe delivered to a frontier bivouac in\nMarjami Ravine.",category=2},
[2404]={id=2404,name="Yor. FB op. materials container",plural="containers of Yorcia frontier bivouac operations materials",description="\nA collection of materials that must\nbe delivered to a frontier bivouac in\nYorcia Weald.",category=2},
[2405]={id=2405,name="Mar. FS building mat. container",plural="containers of Marjami frontier station building materials",description="\nA collection of materials to assist\nin the construction of a frontier\nstation in Marjami Ravine.",category=2},
[2406]={id=2406,name="Yor. FS building mat. container",plural="containers of Yorcia frontier station building materials",description="\nA collection of materials to assist\nin the construction of a frontier\nstation in Yorcia Weald.",category=2},
[2407]={id=2407,name="proof of order: runic headgear",plural="proofs of order: runic headgear",description="\nThis barely legible document is\nscribbled in Jerra Ndala's childish\nhandwriting. It contractually binds\nher to provide its bearer with a\npiece of headgear specially made for\nrune fencers once he pays the\nrequisite amount of bayld.\nIt also reeks of tomatoes.",category=2},
[2408]={id=2408,name="proof of order: runic handgear",plural="proofs of order: runic handgear",description="\nThis barely legible document is\nscribbled in Jerra Ndala's childish\nhandwriting. It contractually binds\nher to provide its bearer with a\nset of handgear specially made for\nrune fencers once he pays the\nrequisite amount of bayld.\nIt also reeks of tomatoes.",category=2},
[2409]={id=2409,name="proof of order: runic footgear",plural="proofs of order: runic footgear",description="\nThis barely legible document is\nscribbled in Jerra Ndala's childish\nhandwriting. It contractually binds\nher to provide its bearer with a\nset of footgear specially made for\nrune fencers once he pays the\nrequisite amount of bayld.\nIt also reeks of tomatoes.",category=2},
[2410]={id=2410,name="Rosulatia's pome",plural="Rosulatia's pomes",description="\nThis mystical fruit, red in color and\nsoft to the touch, was given to you\nby Rosulatia, the leafkin queen.",category=2},
[2411]={id=2411,name="Celennia Memorial Library card",plural="Celennia Memorial Library cards",description="\nDisplaying twelve freshly sharpened swords glinting from the glow of the Sun behind, this card serves as authorization for viewing the shelves upon shelves of knowledge the Scouts' Coalition has stored within the Celennia Memorial Library.",category=2},
[2412]={id=2412,name="\"Sow★Your★Seed!\"",plural="copies of \"Sow★Your★Seed!\"",description="\nThe story of a few young farmtown\nwomen that never actually goes\nanywhere, but has gained massive\npopularity for its revolutionary\neschewal of traditional narrative\ntechniques. Its tale is so enticing\nthat many pioneers who have read it\nhave laid down their arms for the\nplow. Increases the rank of the\nreader's furrows by one.",category=2},
[2413]={id=2413,name="\"My First Furrow\"",plural="copies of \"My First Furrow\"",description="\nA primer to the basics of farming.\nIts prose is easily understandable\neven for beginners, and those who\nfinish reading it report having the\nrank of their furrows\nincrease by one.",category=2},
[2414]={id=2414,name="\"Fields And Fertilizing\"",plural="copies of \"Fields And Fertilizing\"",description="\nA step-by-step instructional guide\nthat focuses specifically on the\nagronomics of Mog Gardens.\nPlastered with a plethora of\npictures as well as the written\nword, this volume also\naccommodates intermediate farmers\nwho learn best by seeing rather than\nreading. Readers report having the\nrank of their furrows\nincrease by one.",category=2},
[2415]={id=2415,name="\"Designer Farming\"",plural="copies of \"Designer Farming\"",description="\nAn advanced manual covering QoS\nDesign-pattering farming--named\nafter the Queen of San d'Oria. It\nexplains the farming method's\ntheoretical framework in-depth and\nits practical applications. Though\nnot a book for beginners, those able\nto understand it report having the\nrank of their furrows\nincrease by one.",category=2},
[2416]={id=2416,name="\"Homesteader's Compendium\"",plural="copies of \"Homesteader's Compendium\"",description="\nThis tome was coauthored by\nKupalika's own Kupofried and\nLytchii, of whom no other records\nremain. It details numerous local\nfarming tips, yet the lack of\nbackground information and its\neccentric prose render it accessible\nonly to sophisticated gardeners.\nThose able to understand it report\nhaving the rank of their furrows\nincrease by one.",category=0},
[2417]={id=2417,name="\"MHMU Treatise on Agronomy\"",plural="copies of \"MHMU Treatise on Agronomy\"",description="\nThe official source on Mog Garden\nfurrow development, issued by the\nMog House Management Union. While\nit purportedly takes a critical\nlook at the farming across\nVana'diel, no one can decipher the\nabstruse and florid style of its\nauthors. Nevertheless, flipping\nthrough its pages might increase\nthe rank of the reader's furrows\nby one.",category=0},
[2419]={id=2419,name="\"Give My Regards to Reodoan\"",plural="copies of \"Give My Regards to Reodoan\"",description="\nA tale based off the legend of\nReodoan, who secretly worked to\nsave the dying forestry industry.\nIt follows a teenage lumberjack torn\nbetween two loves: his forest and\nhis work. Older generations of\nhousewives swoon for the main\ncharacter, but pioneers who read it\nreport having the rank of their\nMog Garden grove increase by one.",category=0},
[2420]={id=2420,name="\"Adoulin's Topiary Treasures\"",plural="copies of \"Adoulin's Topiary Treasures\"",description="\nA collection of watercolor paintings\ndetailing the gardens of those\nbelonging to Adoulin's Twelve\nOrders. Many have gained an\ninterest in pruning and trimming\nsimply from gazing upon these\nstellar examples of topiary\nmagnificence. Pioneers who read it\nreport having the rank of their\nMog Garden grove increase by one.",category=2},
[2421]={id=2421,name="\"Grandiloquent Groves\"",plural="copies of \"Grandiloquent Groves\"",description="\nThis famous \"How-to\" book is as\npertinent to topiary techniques as\nits title suggests, with the majority\nof its pages devoted to unrelated\ntopics such as the number of\nmasons it took to build Jorius Yett\nand the purported thread count of\nArciela's undergarments. Still,\npioneers who read it report having\nthe rank of their Mog Garden grove\nincrease by one.",category=2},
[2422]={id=2422,name="\"Arboreal Abracadabra\"",plural="copies of \"Arboreal Abracadabra\"",description="\nPopular phrases used to describe\nthis tome on landscaping include\n\"ticket to enlightenment\" and\n\"taking control of your destiny.\"\nThe book's numerous illustrations\nmake it easy to understand for\ntopiary artists, but many see it as\nan exercise in self-aggrandizement.\nPioneers who read it report having\nthe rank of their Mog Garden grove\nincrease by one.",category=2},
[2423]={id=2423,name="\"Verdant and Verdon'ts\"",plural="copies of \"Verdant and Verdon'ts\"",description="\nWritten by a vocal anti-colonialist,\nthis thesis asserts that colonization\nis advancing disproportionately fast\ncompared to tree growth, thus\nthreatening Ulbuka's ecological\nbalance. To cure this problem, its\nauthor proposes planting more trees\nin Mog Gardens. Pioneers who read\nit report having the rank of their\nMog Garden grove increase by one.",category=2},
[2424]={id=2424,name="\"MHMU Treatise on Forestry\"",plural="copies of \"MHMU Treatise on Forestry\"",description="\nThe official source on Mog Garden\ngroves, issued by the Mog House\nManagement Union. While it\npurportedly takes a critical look at\nforestry techniques across Vana'diel,\nno one can decipher the abstruse\nand florid style of its authors.\nNevertheless, flipping through its\npages might increase the rank of the\nreader's grove by one.",category=0},
[2426]={id=2426,name="\"Mythril Marathon Quarterly\"",plural="copies of \"Mythril Marathon Quarterly\"",description="\nA magazine that features articles by\nfamous Bastokers. It outlines a\nunique type of race in which guest\nparticipants must carry back mythril\nore from the Palborough Mines, but\nthe concept remains wildly unpopular\noutside of its native home of\nBastok. Pioneers who read it report\nhaving the rank of their Mog Garden\nmineral vein increase by one.",category=0},
[2427]={id=2427,name="\"Take A Lode Off\"",plural="copies of \"Take A Lode Off\"",description="\nCovering a plethora of topics from\nmental preparation to what fashions\nare raging, this handbook for new\nminers is oft denigrated for catering\nto capricious twits who spurn\nmining's serious side to flirt with\nadventurers of the opposite sex.\nStill, pioneers who read it report\nhaving the rank of their Mog Garden\nmineral vein increase by one.",category=2},
[2428]={id=2428,name="\"Varicose Mineral Veins\"",plural="copies of \"Varicose Mineral Veins\"",description="\nWritten by the goldsmith Fatimah,\nthis book is populated with diagrams\nand illustrations explaining how to\nfind the biggest veins possible.\nShort stories accompany the\ndescriptions of rare and valuable\ngems, making the tome ideal for\nbeginners. Pioneers who read it\nreport having the rank of their\nMog Garden mineral vein increase by\none.",category=2},
[2429]={id=2429,name="\"Tales from the Tunnel\"",plural="copies of \"Tales from the Tunnel\"",description="\nThough many of the stories in this\ncollection are surreal--featuring\nprotagonists such as gems and\nhunks of ore--those who understand\nthe basics of mineralogy appreciate\nthe underlying themes sprinkled\nthroughout each fable. Pioneers who\nread it report having the rank of\ntheir Mog Garden mineral vein\nincrease by one.",category=0},
[2430]={id=2430,name="\"The Gusgen Mines Tragedy\"",plural="copies of \"The Gusgen Mines Tragedy\"",description="\nThis book takes a look at how the\nterrible incident that occurred in the\nGusgen Mines could have been\nprevented from a technological\nstandpoint. The meticulous\ndescriptions of highly technical\nsubjects make it difficult to read,\nbut pioneers who do report having\nthe rank of their Mog Garden\nmineral vein increase by one.",category=2},
[2431]={id=2431,name="\"MHMU Treatise on Minerals\"",plural="copies of \"MHMU Treatise on Minerals\"",description="\nThe official source on Mog Garden\nmining, issued by the Mog House\nManagement Union. While it\npurportedly takes a critical look at\nmining techniques across Vana'diel,\nno one can decipher the abstruse\nand florid style of its authors.\nNevertheless, flipping through its\npages might increase the rank of the\nreader's mineral vein by one.",category=0},
[2433]={id=2433,name="\"A Farewell to Freshwater\"",plural="copies of \"A Farewell to Freshwater\"",description="\nThis biography focuses on two boys\ncalled the \"Moat Carp Kin\" by\nSan d'Orians. According to critics, it\nraises more questions--such as,\n\"Why are they still fighting?\"--\nthan it answers. Still, the simplistic\nprose makes it accessible to all.\nPioneers who read it report having\nthe rank of their Mog Garden's\npond dredger increase by one.",category=2},
[2434]={id=2434,name="\"Water, Water Everywhere!\"",plural="copies of \"Water, Water Everywhere!\"",description="\nThe sophomore work of the author\nbehind \"A Farewell to Freshwater,\"\nthis volume tackles the heady\nquestions all inquiring minds want to\nknow about the Moat Carp Kin. It\nalso makes some revolutionary\nclaims, such as, \"One cannot really\nget crystals from crystal bass.\"\nPioneers who read it report having\nthe rank of their Mog Garden's\npond dredger increase by one.",category=2},
[2435]={id=2435,name="\"Dredging's No Drudgery\"",plural="copies of \"Dredging's No Drudgery\"",description="\nA step-by-step instructional guide\nthat focuses specifically on\nfreshwater fishing in Mog Gardens.\nPlastered with a plethora of pictures\nas well as the written word, this\nvolume also accommodates\nintermediate farmers who learn bes\nby seeing rather than reading.\nReaders report having the rank of\ntheir pond dredger increase by one.",category=2},
[2436]={id=2436,name="\"All the Ways to Skin a Carp\"",plural="copies of \"All the Ways to Skin a Carp\"",description="\nA compendium cataloguing the various\nmethods by which a fisherman can\nemploy nets to bring home a\nwhopper--and bragging rights--and\nexplains in detail the ones voted\nthe most popular. Published\nannually, this is the book's eleventh\nedition, and pioneers who read it report\nhaving the rank of their\nMog Garden's pond dredger increase\nby one.",category=2},
[2437]={id=2437,name="\"Anatomy of an Angler\"",plural="copies of \"Anatomy of an Angler\"",description="\nThis collection of interviews from\nworld-renowned net anglers in on\nwhat qualities are necessary for a\nprofessional fisherman to survive\nthe highs and lows of this volatile\nvocation. Pioneers who read it\nreport having the rank of their\nMog Garden's pond dredger\nincrease by one.",category=0},
[2438]={id=2438,name="\"MHMU Treatise on Fish I\"",plural="copies of \"MHMU Treatise on Fish I\"",description="\nThe official source on Mog Garden\nfreshwater fishing, issued by the\nMog House Management Union. While\nit takes a critical look at net\ncasting techniques across\nVana'diel, no one can decipher the\nabstruse and florid style of its\nauthors. Nevertheless, flipping\nthrough its pages might increase\nthe rank of the reader's\npond dredger by one.",category=0},
[2440]={id=2440,name="\"The Old Men of the Sea\"",plural="copies of \"The Old Men of the Sea\"",description="\nA magazine that includes monthly\ninterviews from famous sea\nfishermen all around the world. Many\nmaniacal net casters dream of\nhaving their philosophy on fishing\ndiscussed within its pages, so it\nsports a relatively rabid readership.\nPioneers who read it report having\nthe rank of their Mog Garden's\ncoastal fishing net increase by one.",category=2},
[2441]={id=2441,name="\"Susuroon's Biiig Catch\"",plural="copies of \"Susuroon's Biiig Catch\"",description="\nWhile this children's book has\ngarnered praise from many for\nshowing the young and old how fun\nand invigorating hauling fish in from\nthe sea can be, it is also infamous\nfor the horrendous scribbles the\nQiqirn author boldly claims are\nillustrations. Pioneers who read it\nreport having the rank of their\nMog Garden's coastal fishing net\nincrease by one.",category=2},
[2442]={id=2442,name="\"Black Fish of the Family\"",plural="copies of \"Black Fish of the Family\"",description="\nThis story of a minnow born a\nmidnight hue concentrates on how\nhe overcomes the obstacles imposed\non him from the orange fish of his\nschool. He eventually triumphs over\ntheir prejudices and proves that no\nmatter what the color, all fish are\ncreated equal. Pioneers who read it\nreport having the rank of their\nMog Garden's coastal fishing net\nincrease by one.",category=0},
[2443]={id=2443,name="\"20,000 Yalms Under the Sea\"",plural="copies of \"20,000 Yalms Under the Sea\"",description="\nA tale about how the protagonist,\nNene, builds a submarines all by\nherself and plunges it into the\ndarkest depths of the Senroh Sea.\nShe describes an encyclopedia's\nworth of mystical deep sea\ncreatures, and pioneers who read it\nreport having the rank of their\nMog Garden's coastal fishing net\nincrease by one.",category=2},
[2444]={id=2444,name="\"Encyclopedia Icthyonnica\"",plural="copies of \"Encyclopedia Icthyonnica\"",description="\nThis comprehensive collection\ncontains everything pertaining to\nanything catchable with a net.\nMeasuring five ilms from binding to\nbinding and full of quixotic jargon,\nthis tome is dense in terms of both\nphysical dimensions and content.\nPioneers who read it report having\nthe rank of their Mog Garden's\ncoastal fishing net increase by one.",category=0},
[2445]={id=2445,name="\"MHMU Treatise on Fish II\"",plural="copies of \"MHMU Treatise on Fish II\"",description="\nThe official source on Mog Garden\nsaltwater fishing, issued by the\nMog House Management Union. While\nit takes a critical look at net\ncasting techniques across Vana'diel,\nno one can decipher the abstruse\nand florid style of its authors.\nNevertheless, flipping through its\npages might increase the rank of\nthe reader's coastal fishing net by\none.",category=0},
[2447]={id=2447,name="Mar. FS resource container",plural="containers of Marjami frontier station resources",description="\nA collection of materials from\nMarjami Ravine that are bound\nfor the Couriers' Coalition.",category=2},
[2448]={id=2448,name="Yor. FS resource container",plural="containers of Yorcia frontier station resources",description="\nA collection of materials from\nYorcia Weald that are bound\nfor the Couriers' Coalition.",category=2},
[2449]={id=2449,name="note detailing seditious plans",plural="notes detailing seditious plans",description="\nA scrap of paper with the\nwords \"We strike during the dead\nof night. You know what to do once\ninside the castle.\" hastily\nscrawled upon it.",category=2},
[2450]={id=2450,name="waterway facility crank",plural="waterway facility cranks",description="\nThis terribly rusty crank was once\nfitted to devices that must have\nfallen out of use decades ago.",category=2},
[2451]={id=2451,name="vial of translurry",plural="vials of translurry",description="\nA peculiar liquid flecked with\nbits of indeterminate matter\nsuspended within, this mixture is\nused for transmuting certain pieces\nof equipment.",category=2},
[2452]={id=2452,name="gil repository",plural="gil repositories",description="\nThis rather understated box is\ndesigned to hold up to one billion\ngil. It is kept under constant\nwatch by the Green Thumb Moogle, so\nthere is no need to worry about\nprying hands emptying its contents.",category=2},
[2453]={id=2453,name="crab caller",plural="crab callers",description="\nThis unique device uses pheromonal\nessences to further attract\ncrabaubles in Mog Gardens to you.",category=2},
[2454]={id=2454,name="piece of a stone wall",plural="pieces of a stone wall",description="\nThis piece of stone wall touched by\nthe light of dawn was taken from a\nlighthouse standing in Adoulin\nWaterfront.",category=2},
[2455]={id=2455,name="vial of untainted holy water",plural="vials of untainted holy water",description="\nThis vial of holy water untainted by\nimpurity was taken from the\nfountain in Western Adoulin.",category=2},
[2456]={id=2456,name="eternal flame",plural="eternal flames",description="\nThis flame that has gone\nunextinguished for many years was\ngiven to you by an exorcist in\nEastern Adoulin.",category=3},
[2457]={id=2457,name="weather vane wings",plural="weather vane wings",description="\nThese wings from a weather vane that\nhas stood the test of time were\nretrieved from a storied manse in\nEastern Adoulin.",category=2},
[2458]={id=2458,name="aureate ball of fur",plural="aureate balls of fur",description="\nA matted collection of shed fur that\nonce adorned Darrcuiln's hide. It\nabsorbs any magical traces emitted\nby visitors to the wildcat's cave,\nallowing its bearer to track them.",category=3},
[2459]={id=2459,name="Inventors' Coalition pickaxe",plural="Inventors' Coalition pickaxes",description="\nA made-to-order pickaxe crafted in\ncelebration of Logan's imminent\nreturn.",category=3},
[2460]={id=2460,name="tintinnabulum",plural="tintinnabula",description="\nA small, spherical bell bequeathed\nby Margret. It unleashes an auditory\ncataclysm that Margret assures is\nonly perceptible to certain beasts'\nears.",category=2},
[2461]={id=2461,name="\"Fragmenting\"",plural="\"Fragmenting\"",description="\nA survival skill that grants the\nability to obliterate the ice walls\nthat dot the landscape of Eastern Ulbuka.",category=2},
[2462]={id=2462,name="pair of fuzzy earmuffs",plural="pairs of fuzzy earmuffs",description="\nA warm pair of earmuffs is just what\nan intrepid adventurer needs to\nprotect his ears when he attempts\nto find the weak spot in a barrier of\nice.",category=2},
[2463]={id=2463,name="Kam. FB op. materials container",plural="containers of Kamihr frontier bivouac operations materials",description="\nA collection of materials that must\nbe delivered to a frontier bivouac in\nthe Kamihr Drifts.",category=2},
[2464]={id=2464,name="Kam. FS building mat. container",plural="containers of Kamihr frontier station building materials",description="\nA collection of materials to assist\nin the construction of a frontier\nstation in Kamihr Drifts.",category=2},
[2465]={id=2465,name="Kam. FS resource container",plural="containers of Kamihr frontier station resources",description="\nA collection of materials from\nKamihr Drifts that are bound\nfor the Couriers' Coalition.",category=2},
[2466]={id=2466,name="memorandoll",plural="memorandolls",description="\nThis magic mannequin distributed by\nthe A.M.A.N. records each and every\nRecords of Eminence objective\ncompleted. Coated with a layer of\nastral essence, it slides easily\nbetween dimensions every time its\nowner claps their hands.",category=2},
[2467]={id=2467,name="algor resilience",plural="algor resiliences",description="\nA survival skill that grants the\ntenacity to withstand the\ngraupel formations that protrude\nfrom the banks of Kamihr Drifts.",category=3},
[2468]={id=2468,name="Shadow Lord phantom gem",plural="Shadow Lord phantom gems",description="\nAn ephemerally crystallized corpus\nof memories that revolve around a\nbattle for the ages.",category=2},
[2469]={id=2469,name="Celestial Nexus phantom gem",plural="Celestial Nexus phantom gems",description="\nAn ephemerally crystallized corpus\nof memories that revolve around a\nbattle for the ages.",category=2},
[2470]={id=2470,name="Stellar Fulcrum phantom gem",plural="Stellar Fulcrum phantom gems",description="\nAn ephemerally crystallized corpus\nof memories that revolve around a\nbattle for the ages.",category=2},
[2471]={id=2471,name="phantom gem of apathy",plural="phantom gems of apathy",description="\nAn ephemerally crystallized corpus\nof memories that revolve around a\nbattle for the ages.",category=2},
[2472]={id=2472,name="phantom gem of arrogance",plural="phantom gems of arrogance",description="\nAn ephemerally crystallized corpus\nof memories that revolve around a\nbattle for the ages.",category=2},
[2473]={id=2473,name="phantom gem of envy",plural="phantom gems of envy",description="\nAn ephemerally crystallized corpus\nof memories that revolve around a\nbattle for the ages.",category=2},
[2474]={id=2474,name="phantom gem of cowardice",plural="phantom gems of cowardice",description="\nAn ephemerally crystallized corpus\nof memories that revolve around a\nbattle for the ages.",category=2},
[2475]={id=2475,name="phantom gem of rage",plural="phantom gems of rage",description="\nAn ephemerally crystallized corpus\nof memories that revolve around a\nbattle for the ages.",category=2},
[2476]={id=2476,name="P. Perpetrator phantom gem",plural="Pentacide Perpetrator phantom gems",description="\nAn ephemerally crystallized corpus\nof memories that revolve around a\nbattle for the ages.",category=2},
[2477]={id=2477,name="copper A.M.A.N. voucher",plural="copper A.M.A.N. vouchers",description="\nGiven to adventurers who have proven\nthemselves in Records of Eminence,\nthis tawny and reflective ticket is\nindispensible for acquiring rewards\nfrom the Adventurers' Mutual Aid\nNetwork.",category=2},
[2482]={id=2482,name="Matriarch Naakual paragon",plural="Matriarch Naakual paragons",description="\nA monstrous and perfectly rounded\ngemstone, within which the violent\nwinds associated with Colkhab swirl\nmenacingly. Rumor states that this\nstone is the very reason she can\nsummon destructive gales with a\nsingle twitch of her tail.",category=2},
[2483]={id=2483,name="Riptide Naakual paragon",plural="Riptide Naakual paragons",description="\nA monstrous and perfectly rounded\ngemstone, from within which the\nrelentless pounding of Tchakka's\naquatic lance can be heard. Rumor\nstates that, depending on the\nbearer, this jewel has the power to\ndrown continents.",category=2},
[2484]={id=2484,name="Firebrand Naakual paragon",plural="Firebrand Naakual paragons",description="\nA monstrous and perfectly rounded\ngemstone, within which the scalding\nheat associated with Achuka flares\nrestlessly. Rumor states that, should\nthis gem suffer even a single crack,\nwildfires will rage unstoppable for\nmonths.",category=2},
[2485]={id=2485,name="Ligneous Naakual paragon",plural="Ligneous Naakual paragons",description="\nA monstrous and perfectly rounded\ngemstone, within which the ominous\nrustling of Yumcax's leaves can be\nheard. Rumor states that this jewel\ncan provide harvests bountiful\nenough to feed a city for centuries.",category=2},
[2486]={id=2486,name="Booming Naakual paragon",plural="Booming Naakual paragons",description="\nA monstrous and perfectly rounded\ngemstone, within which the soft\nrumbling of Hurkan's thunderstorms\ncan be heard. Rumor states that,\ndepending on the bearer, this stone\nhas the power to rend the heavens\nin twain.",category=2},
[2487]={id=2487,name="Flashfrost Naakual paragon",plural="Flashfrost Naakual paragons",description="\nA monstrous and perfectly rounded\ngemstone, from which Kumhau's icy\nbreath emanates. Rumor states that\nthis gem can freeze an adversary so\nthoroughly that he cannot be\nthawed even by the heat of a\nthousand hells.",category=2},
[2489]={id=2489,name="Mog Kupon I-AF109",plural="Mog Kupons I-AF109",description="\nIssued by the Mog House Management Union (MHMU).\nTradeable for chapters of Rem's Tale used in reforging job-specific equipment.",category=2},
[2490]={id=2490,name="Mog Kupon W-EWS",plural="Mog Kupons W-EWS",description="\nIssued by the Mog House Management Union (MHMU).\nTradeable for weapons used in acquiring empyrean weaponskills.",category=2},
[2491]={id=2491,name="Mog Kupon AW-WK",plural="Mog Kupons AW-WK",description="\nIssued by the Mog House Management Union (MHMU).\nTradeable for weapons and armor from wildskeeper reives.",category=2},
[2492]={id=2492,name="Mog Kupon I-S3",plural="Mog Kupons I-S3",description="\nIssued by the Mog House Management Union (MHMU).\nTradeable for rank III simulacrum segments.",category=2},
[2493]={id=2493,name="Mog Kupon A-PK109",plural="Mog Kupons A-PK109",description="\nIssued by the Mog House Management Union (MHMU).\nTradeable for item level 109 Peacekeepers' Coalition armor.",category=2},
[2494]={id=2494,name="Mog Kupon I-S1",plural="Mog Kupons I-S1",description="\nIssued by the Mog House Management Union (MHMU).\nTradeable for rank I simulacrum segments.",category=2},
[2495]={id=2495,name="Mog Kupon I-Skill",plural="Mog Kupons I-Skill",description="\nIssued by the Mog House Management Union (MHMU).\nTradeable for skill-boosting tomes.",category=2},
[2496]={id=2496,name="green institute card",plural="green institute cards",description="\nThis emerald green card received in\nWindurst from the finicky Wetata of\nthe Jeuno Institute of Magical\nStudies permits the bearer to\nparticipate in the Trust initiative.",category=2},
[2497]={id=2497,name="Windurst Trust permit",plural="Windurst Trust permits",description="\nThis small certificate from Kupipi\npermits the bearer to officially use\nTrust magic.",category=2},
[2498]={id=2498,name="blue institute card",plural="blue institute cards",description="\nThis sapphire blue card received in\nBastok from the wishy-washy Clarion\nStar of the Jeuno Institute of\nMagical Studies permits the bearer\nto participate in the Trust initiative.",category=2},
[2499]={id=2499,name="Bastok Trust permit",plural="Bastok Trust permits",description="\nThis small certificate from Naji\npermits the bearer to officially use\nTrust magic.",category=2},
[2500]={id=2500,name="red institute card",plural="red institute cards",description="\nThis ruby red card received in San\nd'Oria from the affable Gondebaud\nof the Jeuno Institute of Magical\nStudies permits the bearer to\nparticipate in the Trust initiative.",category=2},
[2501]={id=2501,name="San d'Oria Trust permit",plural="San d'Oria Trust permits",description="\nThis small certificate from\nExcenmille permits the bearer to\nofficially use Trust magic.",category=2},
[2502]={id=2502,name="Mog Kupon I-RME",plural="Mog Kupons I-RME",description="\nIssued by the Mog House Management Union (MHMU).\nTradeable for pluton, beitetsu, and riftborn boulders.",category=2},
[2503]={id=2503,name="\"Pulverizing\"",plural="\"Pulverizing\"",description="\nA survival skill that grants the\nability to eradicate the occult\ndoorways that dot the landscape of\nEastern Ulbuka.",category=2},
[2504]={id=2504,name="Lerene's paten",plural="Lerene's patens",description="\nThis small paten fashioned by\nLerene dissolves magic enshrouding\nthe doors within Ra'Kaznar,\nenabling the bearer to smash them\nto bits.",category=2},
[2505]={id=2505,name="Amchuchu's Missive",plural="Amchuchu's Missives",description="\nThis missive addressed to Cid explains in a roundabout manner that Midras is deemed to have done no wrong in the eyes of the Inventors' Coalition.",category=3},
[2506]={id=2506,name="Temple Knight key",plural="Temple Knight keys",description="\nThis master key to the Sacrarium\nheld by Quelveuiat may only be\ncarried by chevaliers of purest heart\nand mind.",category=2},
[2507]={id=2507,name="unblemished pioneer's badge",plural="unblemished pioneer's badges",description="\nThis brand-new badge proving one's\nstatus as participant in the\ncolonization initiative purportedly\nbelongs to Emjook-Renook.",category=3},
[2508]={id=2508,name="silvery plate",plural="silvery plates",description="\nPale blue light blinks off this silvery\nplate, which is needed to operate\nthe lifts within Ra'Kaznar.",category=2},
[2509]={id=2509,name="soul siphon",plural="soul siphons",description="\nOnce worn by Ingrid, this pendant\nharbors occult powers that interact\nnegatively with spiritual energy,\nwhich she used to separate Arciela's\ntranscendental soul from its\ncorporeal form.",category=2},
[2510]={id=2510,name="bundle of half-inscribed scrolls",plural="bundles of half-inscribed scrolls",description="\nThese scrolls, supplied to you by\nJamal of the Jeuno Institute of\nMagical Studies, are magical\ntableaus referred to as \"ciphers,\"\nand call upon the bonds of a third\nparty to summon another being into\nthis world.",category=2},
[2511]={id=2511,name="tapestry of bagua poetry",plural="tapestries of bagua poetry",description="\nShort, rhyming verses about Ulbuka's\nnatural scenery are inscribed on this\nminiature tapestry. Turning it over\non its side reveals some strange\nwriting whose mysteries are begging\nto be solved.",category=2},
[2512]={id=2512,name="Futharkic Concepts in Flux",plural="copies of Futharkic Concepts in Flux",description="\nThis revisionist treatise mainly\nexpands upon the phasal shift\ntheory that currently enjoys much\npopularity among prominent\nruneologists. Authored by an\nanonymous individual, it imparts\nnothing particularly new on\nfirst glance.",category=2},
[2513]={id=2513,name="crystallized lifestream essence",plural="crystallized lifetream essences",description="\nA soft warmth radiates from this\nbrightly glowing crystal formed from\nthe energies of gargantuan tree\nroots in Ra'Kaznar.",category=2},
[2514]={id=2514,name="strand of Ra'Kaznar filament",plural="strands of Ra'Kaznar filament",description="\nRemoved from a specific Ra'Kaznar\npartition, this fiber is so translucent\nit nearly escapes the naked eye.\nEach individual weave rhythmically\nswells with sorcerous energy.",category=2},
[2515]={id=2515,name="order slip: lifestream headgear",plural="order slips: lifestream headgear",description="\nThe bubbly Wescolina provided you\nwith this proof of purchase of a\npiece of bagua armor. Return to her at a later date to collect your order.",category=3},
[2516]={id=2516,name="order slip: lifestream bodygear",plural="order slips: lifestream bodygear",description="\nThe bubbly Wescolina provided you\nwith this proof of purchase of a\npiece of bagua armor. Return to her\nat a later date to collect your\norder.",category=3},
[2517]={id=2517,name="order slip: lifestream handgear",plural="order slips: lifestream handgear",description="\nThe bubbly Wescolina provided you\nwith this proof of purchase of a\npiece of bagua armor. Return to her\nat a later date to collect your\norder.",category=3},
[2518]={id=2518,name="order slip: lifestream leggear",plural="order slips: lifestream leggear",description="\nThe bubbly Wescolina provided you\nwith this proof of purchase of a\npiece of bagua armor. Return to her\nat a later date to collect your\norder.",category=2},
[2519]={id=2519,name="order slip: lifestream footgear",plural="order slips: lifestream footgear",description="\nThe bubbly Wescolina provided you\nwith this proof of purchase of a\npiece of bagua armor. Return to her\nat a later date to collect your\norder.",category=2},
[2520]={id=2520,name="order slip: logomorph headgear",plural="order slips: logomorph headgear",description="\nThis barely legible document is\nwritten in the hurried hand of the\nslightly snobbish--if not skillful--\nYestin-Ovestin. It promises that the\nclothier extraordinaire will provide a\npiece of runic armor once he deems\nhis handiwork blemishless.",category=3},
[2521]={id=2521,name="order slip: logomorph bodygear",plural="order slips: logomorph bodygear",description="\nThis barely legible document is\nwritten in the hurried hand of the\nslightly snobbish--if not skillful--\nYestin-Ovestin. It promises that the\nclothier extraordinaire will provide a\npiece of runic armor once he deems\nhis handiwork blemishless.",category=3},
[2522]={id=2522,name="order slip: logomorph handgear",plural="order slips: logomorph handgear",description="\nThis barely legible document is\nwritten in the hurried hand of the\nslightly snobbish--if not skillful--\nYestin-Ovestin. It promises that the\nclothier extraordinaire will provide a\npiece of runic armor once he deems\nhis handiwork blemishless.",category=3},
[2523]={id=2523,name="order slip: logomorph leggear",plural="order slips: logomorph leggear",description="\nThis barely legible document is\nwritten in the hurried hand of the\nslightly snobbish--if not skillful--\nYestin-Ovestin. It promises that the\nclothier extraordinaire will provide a\npiece of runic armor once he deems\nhis handiwork blemishless.",category=3},
[2524]={id=2524,name="order slip: logomorph footgear",plural="order slips: logomorph footgear",description="\nThis barely legible document is\nwritten in the hurried hand of the\nslightly snobbish--if not skillful--\nYestin-Ovestin. It promises that the\nclothier extraordinaire will provide a\npiece of runic armor once he deems\nhis handiwork blemishless.",category=3},
[2525]={id=2525,name="pristine hair ribbon",plural="pristine hair ribbons",description="\nThis auburn ribbon, oft worn by\nArciela as she headed to the\nUlbukan wildlands, was found lying\nin the dirt of Ceizak Battlegrounds,\nwhere she was last seen.",category=2},
[2526]={id=2526,name="vial of transmelange",plural="vials of transmelange",description="\nA peculiar liquid flecked with\nbits of indeterminate matter\nsuspended within, this mixture is\nused for transmuting certain pieces\nof equipment.",category=2},
[2527]={id=2527,name="lost article",plural="lost articles",description="\nLeft behind by a careless pioneer,\nthis article should be delivered to\nthe Mummers' Coalition with utmost\nhaste.",category=2},
[2528]={id=2528,name="breath of dawn",plural="breaths of dawn",description="\nLight as a feather, this object slips\naway the more you strive to grasp\nit.",category=2},
[2529]={id=2529,name="phlox yantric planchette",plural="phlox yantric planchettes",description="\nThis board is made of finely\npolished phlox yggrete and is\nattuned to lift the veil in\nMarjami Ravine shrouding an\nobscured domain.",category=2},
[2530]={id=2530,name="russet yantric planchette",plural="russet yantric planchettes",description="\nThis board is made of finely\npolished russet yggrete and is\nattuned to lift the veil in\nYorcia Weald shrouding an\nobscured domain.",category=2},
[2531]={id=2531,name="aster yantric planchette",plural="aster yantric planchettes",description="\nThis board is made of finely\npolished aster yggrete and is\nattuned to lift the veil in\nKamihr Drifts shrouding an\nobscured domain.",category=3},
[2532]={id=2532,name="sparking tail feather",plural="sparking tail feathers",description="\nPlucked from Cailimh, Marjami Ravine's\navian terror, this caudal plumage\nstill occasionally emits an electric\npulse.",category=2},
[2533]={id=2533,name="piece of inviolable bark",plural="pieces of inviolable bark",description="\nMercilessly ripped from the trunk of\nWopket, a ligneous abomination\nrooted in the obscured domain\nwithin Yorcia Weald, this hunk of\nwooden armor drips with a quickly\nhardening sap.",category=2},
[2534]={id=2534,name="frosted incisor",plural="frosted incisors",description="\nWrenched from the mouth of Utkux,\nthe chill-inducing feline that hunts\nalong the tundra of Kamihr Drifts,\nthis frigid tooth is encrusted in\nsmall, knife-edged ice crystals.",category=2},
[2535]={id=2535,name="impure phlox yggzi",plural="impure phlox yggzi",description="\nA petrified phlox yggzi bead of\nquestionable quality.",category=3},
[2536]={id=2536,name="semi-pure phlox yggzi",plural="semi-pure phlox yggzi",description="\nA semi-pure petrified phlox yggzi\nbead with large variances in shape.",category=2},
[2537]={id=2537,name="impure russet yggzi",plural="impure russet yggzi",description="\nA petrified russet yggzi bead of\nquestionable quality.",category=3},
[2538]={id=2538,name="semi-pure russet yggzi",plural="semi-pure russet yggzi",description="\nA semi-pure petrified russet yggzi\nbead with large variances in shape.",category=2},
[2539]={id=2539,name="impure aster yggzi",plural="impure aster yggzi",description="\nA petrified aster yggzi bead of\nquestionable quality.",category=3},
[2540]={id=2540,name="semi-pure aster yggzi",plural="semi-pure aster yggzi",description="\nA semi-pure petrified aster yggzi\nbead with large variances in shape.",category=2},
[2541]={id=2541,name="breath of dawn",plural="breaths of dawn",description="\nLight as a feather, this object found\nin Ronfaure in the Shadowreign Era\nslips away the more you strive to\ngrasp it.",category=2},
[2542]={id=2542,name="breath of dawn",plural="breaths of dawn",description="\nLight as a feather, this object found\nin Jugner Forest in the Shadowreign\nEra slips away the more you strive\nto grasp it.",category=2},
[2543]={id=2543,name="breath of dawn",plural="breaths of dawn",description="\nLight as a feather, this object found\nin Beaucedine Glacier in the\nShadowreign Era slips away the more\nyou strive to grasp it.",category=2},
[2544]={id=2544,name="job breaker",plural="job breakers",description="\nYou have been recognized by Nomad\nMoogles across Vana'diel as an\nexpert in your profession.",category=2},
[2545]={id=2545,name="Savage's phantom gem",plural="Savage's phantom gems",description="\nAn ephemerally crystallized corpus\nof memories that revolve around a\nbattle for the ages.",category=2},
[2546]={id=2546,name="Warrior's Path phantom gem",plural="Warrior's Path phantom gems",description="\nAn ephemerally crystallized corpus\nof memories that revolve around a\nbattle for the ages.",category=2},
[2547]={id=2547,name="Peppe-Aleppe's superlative tonic",plural="Peppe-Aleppe's superlative tonics",description="\nThis foul-smelling liquid, made from\nthe natural oils contained in\nruszor leather, protects against the\nbiting gales expelled from vents in\nKamihr Drifts.",category=2},
[2548]={id=2548,name="Sajj'aka's protective ward",plural="Sajj'aka's protective wards",description="\nSajj'aka infused this small athame\nwith a miniscule portion of the\nlatent energies protecting the wilds.",category=2},
[2549]={id=2549,name="sunkissed scale",plural="sunkissed scales",description="\nThis scale, scoured wholesale from\nSajj'aka's chest, glows a vibrant\nyellow as bright as the\nmid-noon sun.",category=2},
[2550]={id=2550,name="moontouched scale",plural="moontouched scales",description="\nThis scale, scoured wholesale from\nSajj'aka's chest, glows a pale amber\nas soft as a lenten moon.",category=2},
[2551]={id=2551,name="starblessed scale",plural="starblessed scales",description="\nThis scale, scoured wholesale from\nSajj'aka's chest, glows a twinkling\nwhite as sparkling as the nighttime\nsky.",category=2},
[2552]={id=2552,name="tuft of golden fur",plural="tufts of golden fur",description="\nThis fluffy fistful seems to be\ncalling you to Darrcuiln's master...",category=2},
[2553]={id=2553,name="ivory wing talisman",plural="ivory wing talismans",description="\nA charm crafted in the shape of\nivory wings, the symbol of the\nGoddess Altana. Reduces the amount\nof experience lost when\nknocked out during reives.",category=3},
[2554]={id=2554,name="silver mattock cordon",plural="silver mattock cordons",description="\nEmbroidered with a gleaming\nsilver mattock, this badge is given\nonly to pioneers who have gone above\nand beyond the call of duty in\nadvancing the colonization\ninitiative. Increases the maximum\nnumber of coalition imprimaturs able\nto be held at one time.",category=2},
[2555]={id=2555,name="silver shovel cordon",plural="silver shovel cordons",description="\nEmbroidered with a gleaming\nsilver shovel, this badge is given\nonly to pioneers who have gone\nabove and beyond the call of duty\nin advancing the colonization\ninitiative. Reduces the\nwaiting period for new\ncoalition imprimaturs.",category=2},
[2556]={id=2556,name="Puppet in Peril phantom gem",plural="Puppet in Peril phantom gems",description="\nAn ephemerally crystallized corpus\nof memories that revolve around a\nbattle for the ages.",category=2},
[2557]={id=2557,name="Legacy phantom gem",plural="Legacy phantom gems",description="\nAn ephemerally crystallized corpus\nof memories that revolve around a\nbattle for the ages.",category=2},
[2558]={id=2558,name="World Tree sapling",plural="World Tree saplings",description="\nSajj'aka procured this 12-ilm tall\nsapling from a Lightsland sheltered\naway in an unknown location. It is\nsaid August planted one in the most\nsacred area of Ulbuka...",category=2},
[2559]={id=2559,name="Mog Kupon I-???",plural="Mog Kupon I-???",description="\nIssued by the Mog House Management Union (MHMU).",category=2},
[2560]={id=2560,name="Mog Kupon W-Job",plural="Mog Kupon W-Job",description="\nIssued by the Mog House Management Union (MHMU).\nTradeable for job-specific weapons crafted by Oboro.",category=2},
[2561]={id=2561,name="Mog Kupon I-Mat",plural="Mog Kupon I-Mat",description="\nIssued by the Mog House Management Union (MHMU).\nTradeable for various special materials.",category=2},
[2562]={id=2562,name="Mog Kupon W-DeIII",plural="Mog Kupon W-DeIII",description="\nIssued by the Mog House Management Union (MHMU).\nTradeable for weapons from Delve bosses.",category=2},
[2563]={id=2563,name="Mog Kupon AW-Mis",plural="Mog Kupon AW-Mis",description="\nIssued by the Mog House Management Union (MHMU).\nTradeable for spoils from high-tier mission battlefields other than ★A Stygian Pact, ★Champion of the Dawn, ★Divine Interference, and ★Maiden of the Dusk.",category=2},
[2564]={id=2564,name="sheet of Zilart tunes",plural="sheets of Zilart tunes",description="\nSheet music that can be played on\nan orchestrion.\n\nMusic List:\nKazham\nThe Sanctuary of Zi'Tah\nTu'Lia",category=2},
[2565]={id=2565,name="rusted handbell",plural="rusted handbells",description="\nCovered in a layer of rust, this\ncracked handbell has seen\nbetter days, and issues forth\nno sound even with the\nstrongest of shakes.",category=2},
[2566]={id=2566,name="emblazoned handbell",plural="emblazoned handbells",description="\nHigh-purity bayld infused this bell\nwith geomantic energy. Its ring\nechoes clear and true.",category=3},
[2567]={id=2567,name="Ripple Prominence concretion",plural="Ripple Prominence concretions",description="\nCreated from high-purity bayld, this\ncrystal imparts the bearer with an\nintense feeling of sadness.",category=2},
[2568]={id=2568,name="inferno concretion",plural="inferno concretions",description="\nCreated from high-purity bayld, this\ncrystal imparts the bearer with an\nintense enthusiasm.",category=3},
[2569]={id=2569,name="cyclone concretion",plural="cyclone concretions",description="\nCreated from high-purity bayld, this\ncrystal imparts the bearer with an\nintense feeling of affection.",category=2},
[2570]={id=2570,name="numbing blossom seed",plural="numbing blossom seeds",description="\nThis nascent wild peril exudes a\nspecial oil that is used in the\nmanufacture of myriad goods.",category=2},
[2571]={id=2571,name="broken rapier hilt",plural="broken rapier hilts",description="\nThe rusted remains of an ancient\nsword. The blade itself has been\nsevered just above its base,\nrendering it completely useless.",category=2},
[2572]={id=2572,name="vial of crimson catalyst",plural="vials of crimson catalyst",description="\nRumors surrounding this\nviolently red solution state that it\nenables the bearer to travel to\nworlds beyond by suppressing his\nrunic powers. Should it fall into the\nhands of a fool, however, his\npuissance shall be sealed away\nfor all eternity.",category=2},
[2573]={id=2573,name="\"Quiescence\"",plural="\"Quiescence\" runes",description="\nBestowed upon rune fencers who have awakened to their true potential, the character itself causes a bright light to shine around its bearer.",category=2},
[2574]={id=2574,name="superlative runic ring of deluge",plural="superlative runic rings of deluge",description="\nPurchased with high-purity bayld and\nfashioned via a clandestine\nprocess of synthesis, this ring\nimparts its bearer with the chill of\nan icy waterfall.",category=2},
[2575]={id=2575,name="superlative runic ring of luster",plural="superlative runic rings of luster",description="\nPurchased with high-purity bayld and\nfashioned via a clandestine\nprocess of synthesis, this ring\nintermittently glows as bright as\na flash of lightning.",category=2},
[2576]={id=2576,name="superlative runic ring of vision",plural="superlative runic rings of vision",description="\nPurchased with high-purity bayld and\nfashioned via a clandestine\nprocess of synthesis, this ring\nimparts its bearer with an acute\nfeeling of transience, as if\nhe is dreaming.",category=2},
[2577]={id=2577,name="nicked dagger",plural="nicked daggers",description="\nViscous fluid covers this blade,\nfound in the brush in Foret de\nHennetiel. The tip has been\ncompletely shattered.",category=2},
[2578]={id=2578,name="magicked astrolabe",plural="magicked astrolabes",description="\nEtched into this board's wooden\nsurface is a detailed depiction of\nastral body relationships, with small\ngems representing each of the\ndifferent constellations.",category=2},
[2579]={id=2579,name="bracelet of verve",plural="bracelets of verve",description="\nThe might of a thousand trolls\npulses in the metal confines of this\ntrinket.",category=2},
[2580]={id=2580,name="copy of \"Wrath of the Land\"",plural="copies of \"Wrath of the Land\"",description="\n\"Multiple sources corroborate the\nintermittent occurrence of\nlandshivers throughout the\ncenturies, but almost none mention\nsuch phenomena before the Ulbukan\ncontinent was buried under a dense\njungle.\"\nAoWv",category=2},
[2581]={id=2581,name="copy of \"Hallowed Wood\"",plural="copies of \"Hallowed Wood\"",description="\nThis painting of a sacred tree is\nthought to have been finished around\nCrystal Era 480 and is widely\nconsidered one of the most\ninfluential landscapes in\nAdoulinian history.",category=2},
[2582]={id=2582,name="\"Hallowed Wood\" replica",plural="\"Hallowed Wood\" replicas",description="\nAn imitation of the famous ancient\nAdoulinian painting that depicts a\nsacred tree.",category=2},
[2583]={id=2583,name="copy of \"Shrouded in Enigma\"",plural="copies of \"Shrouded in Enigma\"",description="\nAn article with the intriguing\nheadline of \"Scoop of the century!\nGentleman of the Night's identity\ndiscovered!\" but ends with a\ndisappointing \"Everyone has a bit\nof the Gentleman inside them.\"\nJt",category=2},
[2584]={id=2584,name="report of a sorcerous nation",plural="reports of a sorcerous nation",description="\n\"Though Sverdhried is most often\nknown for his rigorous training on\nthe large hillock in Eastern Adoulin,\nhe also traveled the world. One spot\nhe supposedly visited was a\nnow-forgotten country on the\nRhazowan continent.\"",category=2},
[2585]={id=2585,name="copy of \"The Verdancy\"",plural="copies of \"The Verdancy\"",description="\n\"I shall write only what I have\nseen, with no embellishments. Not\nonly had the trees I cleared to make\na path grown back overnight, but\nthe whole of Ulbuka was covered in\nvegetation! Just what has possessed\nthis land?\"\nJvJo",category=2},
[2586]={id=2586,name="giant sheep export record",plural="giant sheep export records",description="\nA simple clerical document noting\nthe export of domesticated giant\nsheep to the Quon continent in\nCrystal Era 607 along with the exact\nprice of the transaction.\nWhAt",category=2},
[2587]={id=2587,name="dictum on colonization",plural="dicta on colonization",description="\n\"...the citizens of.... In accordance\nwith.........any acts...elopment or\ncoloni...no lo...bbiden. However, this\ndoes no......to deface or oth...harm\nto...orest.\"\nJt",category=2},
[2588]={id=2588,name="Adoulinian agricultural treatise",plural="Adoulinian agricultural treatises",description="\n\"Due to the poor quality of our\nsoil, we have mostly failed in our\nagrarian pursuits. However, trading\ngiant sheep for flour milled in the\nZulkheim region and constructing a\ngreenhouse in the Rala Waterways\nhave somewhat mitigated our woes.\"",category=3},
[2589]={id=2589,name="mystifying metal rod",plural="mystifying metal rods",description="\nThis long metal projection found in\nthe Woh Gates is heavier than its\nappearance would make it seem.",category=2},
[2590]={id=2590,name="rusty katana",plural="rusty katanas",description="\nThis blade is thought to be one of\nthe traditional military swords used\nby ancient Adoulinians. The layers\nof rust that encompass it are so\nthick that the katana cannot be\nremoved from its sheath.",category=2},
[2591]={id=2591,name="traditional Adoulinian katana",plural="traditional Adoulinian katanas",description="\nA military-issue sword used during\nthe internal struggle that took place\nbetween the Twelve Orders. Its\nweight could very well symbolize the\nheavy heart with which its owner\nswung the blade.",category=2},
[2592]={id=2592,name="piece of a SCT Coalition report",plural="pieces of a Scouts' Coalition report",description="\nThis appears to be nothing more\nthan a scrap torn from a\nlarger sheet of normal paper.",category=2},
[2593]={id=2593,name="cryptic memorandum",plural="cryptic memorandums",description="\nsoft embrace = repugnant face\nrid = rob\nsorrows = joy\nsun = underworld\nrise every morrow = consume and destroy\nlove = loathe\nset me free = should hang from a tree",category=2},
[2594]={id=2594,name="memo found in Rala Waterways",plural="memos found in Rala Waterways",description="\n  k v s h o t\nA A B C D E F\nG G H --J K L\nJ M ----P Q R\nW S T ----W X\nR Y ---------\nWe------------",category=2},
[2595]={id=2595,name="Head Wind phantom gem",plural="Head Wind phantom gems",description="\nAn ephemerally crystallized corpus\nof memories that revolve around a\nbattle for the ages.",category=2},
[2596]={id=2596,name="butterfly-shaped key",plural="butterfly-shaped keys",description="\nThis small key, comprised of two intertwined bands of metal, opens the door to the sealed arena in the Walk of Echoes.",category=2},
[2597]={id=2597,name="sturdy hide pouch",plural="sturdy hide pouches",description="\nThis hardened leather pouch bequeathed upon you by the Blackthorn Coven has separate compartments for holding water from various ergon loci.",category=2},
[2598]={id=2598,name="\"Suffering Sacchariferous\"",plural="copies of \"Suffering Sacchariferous\"",description="\nOften cited as the definitive\ncookbook for young women who\nexhibit a soft spot for sweets,\nthis volume details dozens of\nadorable recipes. Even the cover is\nenticing enough to eat, though that\nwould surely put the Celennia\nMemorial Library out a coveted text.",category=2},
[2599]={id=2599,name="sepulcher ensign",plural="sepulcher ensigns",description="\nFormerly one of Chancellor Ygnas's\npossessions, this slightly disturbing\ninsignia emits an almost maternal\nwarmth. It also appears to serve as\na key to the founder king's\nresting place.",category=2},
[2600]={id=2600,name="consummate simulacrum",plural="consummate simulacra",description="\nA simulacrum Balamor dispersed to a\nfrenzied beast that stalked the\nwaterways. Logic dictates that\nholding it up to an Augural\nConveyor in Rala Waterways should\ndo the trick.",category=2},
[2601]={id=2601,name="broken fuse",plural="broken fuses",description="\nThis scorched fuse was likely the\nsource of a massive explosion in\nRala Waterways.",category=2},
[2602]={id=2602,name="Rala eudaemon",plural="Rala eudaemons",description="\nA statue assembled from four\ndifferent segments that grants its\nbearer access to alluvion skirmishes\nin Rala Waterways [U].",category=2},
[2603]={id=2603,name="Yorcia eudaemon",plural="Yorcia eudaemons",description="\nA statue assembled from four\ndifferent segments that grants its\nbearer access to alluvion skirmishes\nin Yorcia Weald [U].",category=2},
[2604]={id=2604,name="Cirdas eudaemon",plural="Cirdas eudaemons",description="\nA statue assembled from four\ndifferent segments that grants its\nbearer access to alluvion skirmishes\nin Cirdas Caverns [U].",category=2},
[2606]={id=2606,name="Velkk fetish",plural="Velkk fetishes",description="\nThis charm, often used by Velkk\nmystics in unholy rituals, is\nfashioned from the hide of one of\ntheir own.",category=2},
[2607]={id=2607,name="Ymmr-Ulvid's necklace",plural="Ymmr-Ulvid's necklaces",description="\nThe noxious odor emanating from\nthis most unfashionable bauble once\nowned by Ymmr-Ulvid Gloomlight\ncauses nearby flora to wither.",category=3},
[2608]={id=2608,name="Ignor-Mnt's bracelet",plural="Ignor-Mnt's bracelets",description="\nIgnor-Mnt Stealthslayer used only\nthe most rusted and repulsive of\nmetal scraps to fashion this\nabomination.",category=3},
[2609]={id=2609,name="Durs-Vike's earring",plural="Durs-Vike's earrings",description="\nOnly Durs-Vike Deathspell could pull\noff leathery charms of as\nmalodorous an attire as these.",category=2},
[2610]={id=2610,name="Tryl-Wuj's belt",plural="Tryl-Wuj's belts",description="\nThis belt, once proudly worn by\nTryl-Wuj Wingrip as a sign of his\nmany victories in battle, is so worn\nand rancid that it's impossible to\ndiscern whether it is leather or\ncloth.",category=2},
[2611]={id=2611,name="pair of Liij-Vok's gloves",plural="pairs of Liij-Vok's gloves",description="\nThe numerous pricks and holes in\nthis flimsy hand attire are indicative\nof where Liij-Vok Waxwane's scaly\nflesh tore at the inseams.",category=2},
[2612]={id=2612,name="Gramk-Droog's circlet",plural="Gramk-Droog's circlets",description="\nA symbol of power amongst the\nVelkk, this circlet confers upon its\nbearer a measure of barbarous\nauthority.",category=2},
[2613]={id=2613,name="elder wooden box",plural="elder wooden boxes",description="\nThough old, this box still maintains\nits original shape.",category=3},
[2614]={id=2614,name="imprint device S",plural="imprint devices S",description="\nThis wooden device is said to\ntransmit images of the past to its\nbearer when held up to the forehead\nunder certain conditions. Disposable.",category=3},
[2615]={id=2615,name="record of the generals' foray",plural="records of the generals' foray",description="\nThis recording depicts August and\nhis eleven generals pitted in a\nmomentous struggle against a\nwinged beast. Swirling storms and\nbooming thunder are etched into the\nplate.",category=2},
[2616]={id=2616,name="record of a cavernous foray",plural="records of a cavernous foray",description="\nThis recording depicts August and\nhis eleven generals in a phalanx\nformation as they assault a\nsickly-colored fiend. A choking\nmiasma is seared into the plate.",category=2},
[2617]={id=2617,name="record of the knight in black",plural="records of the knight in black",description="\nThis recording depicts August facing\noff against a man of unknown\norigin. What happened after their\ninauspicious meeting is lost to the\nages, but the weight of their\npresence is ingrained into the plate.",category=2},
[2618]={id=2618,name="record of a thousand lights",plural="records of a thousand lights",description="\nThis record depicts the miracle that\nCeizak bore witness to. A brilliant\nwall of light dispelled the forces of\ndarkness and scattered the\nremaining Velkk armies. The will of\nJorius is inscribed into the plate.",category=2},
[2619]={id=2619,name="avatar phantom gem",plural="avatar phantom gems",description="\nAn ephemerally crystallized corpus\nof memories that revolve around a\nbattle for the ages.",category=3},
[2620]={id=2620,name="Heroes and Legends of Adoulin",plural="Heroes and Legends of Adoulin",description="\nThis volume, faithfully transcribed by\nOshasha, boasts not only myriad tales\nof heroic deeds and valorous tales of\nAugust and his eleven generals, but\ndetails the minutiae of their personality\nquirks, hopes, and fears.",category=2},
[2621]={id=2621,name="hastily scribbled note",plural="hastily scribbled notes",description="\nThough the envelope is delicately\nsealed with wax in the shape of a\nswallow, the letter inside contains\nbut two words: \"The port.\"",category=2},
[2622]={id=2622,name="sky blue pome",plural="sky blue pomes",description="\nThis pome from Rosulatia, blue as\nthe sky on a clear winter day,\nbeckons you to a spot of power in\nYorcia Weald.",category=2},
[2623]={id=2623,name="sun yellow pome",plural="sun yellow pomes",description="\nThis pome from Rosulatia, yellow as\nthe sun at high noon, beckons you\nto a spot of power in Cirdas\nCaverns.",category=2},
[2624]={id=2624,name="Ashrakk's blood sigil",plural="Ashrakk's blood sigils",description="\nThis pulsating red abomination, which\nfits not-so-cleanly in the palm of\nyour hand, was severed from the\nbody of Ashrakk, the Duskbrood Xol.",category=3},
[2625]={id=2625,name="Dhokmak's blood sigil",plural="Dhokmak's blood sigils",description="\nThis pulsating red abomination, which\nfits not-so-cleanly in the palm of\nyour hand, was severed from the\nbody of Dhokmak, the Brash Xol.",category=2},
[2626]={id=2626,name="ash runic board",plural="ash runic boards",description="\nThough the script seared into the\nboard is wholly illegible, Teodor\nclaims it is a key to enter the\nWatergarden Coliseum in Rala\nWaterways.",category=3},
[2627]={id=2627,name="Teodor's blood sigil",plural="Teodor's blood sigils",description="\nThis pulsating red abomination, which\nfits not-so-cleanly in the palm of\nyour hand, was severed from the\nbody of Teodor, the former\nDeathborne Xol.",category=2},
[2628]={id=2628,name="awakened crystallized psyche",plural="awakened crystallized psyches",description="\nThe will of Tartarus pulses\nfervently, beckoning you to where\nHades awaits.",category=3},
[2629]={id=2629,name="Arciela's spare bonnet",plural="Arciela's spare bonnets",description="\nArciela bequeathed unto you one of\nher spare white summer bonnets...but\nit feels like something is missing.",category=3},
[2630]={id=2630,name="Arciela's skirt",plural="Arciela's skirts",description="\nIt was undoubtedly improper for you\nto obtain an item of such a personal\nnature, but the ornate plates of\nadaman and gold make it as fanciful\nas it is eye-catching.",category=3},
[2631]={id=2631,name="concordoll",plural="concordolls",description="\nThis magic mannequin distributed by\nthe A.M.A.N. bonds with memorandolls\nfrom Records of Eminence, recording\nthe deeds of those participating in\nUnity Concord. It also enables\nlong-distance communiques similar\nto those of linkshell origin.\nModel No.: U-lyne-0.",category=2},
[2632]={id=2632,name="crystallized psyche",plural="crystallized psyches",description="\nThe three blood sigils wrested from\ncontrol of the Xol Triumvirate have\ncoagulated into a pure black stone.\nThe gates of Ra'Kaznar Turris\nshould open now.",category=2},
[2633]={id=2633,name="\"Sakura and the Magic Spoon\"",plural="copies of \"Sakura and the Magic Spoon\"",description="\nThis work of fiction written by\nMarkovic details a magic spoon used\nby the prestigious Sakura that, when\nused to consume a meal, enables her\nto communicate with all living\nthings. Pioneers who read it report\nhaving their monster rearing rank\nincrease by one.",category=2},
[2640]={id=2640,name="blank ash runic board",plural="blank ash runic boards",description="\nThe lettering on the slate\nbequeathed unto you by Teodor has\ncompletely vanished.",category=2},
[2641]={id=2641,name="prototype sigil pearl",plural="prototype sigil pearls",description="\nThe marbled swirlings in this pearl can copy and replicate information gleaned from the memories of the bearer's battles.",category=2},
[2642]={id=2642,name="lamb memento",plural="lamb mementos",description="\nA pleasant memory of a lamb within\nthe Mog Garden that gives\nChacharoon the strength to cheer\nyou on.",category=2},
